          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu iyie, ee Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel, naitayio ena bolunoto aitodol osinka lino, ijo, ‘Kaashetaki iyie enkaji;’ neaku etagolo osinka lino oshoke pee kiomon iyie ena omono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore taata, iyie Olaitoriani Enkai, iyie Enkai, nesipa irorei linono, nisiligie ena toki sidai osinka lino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore naa taata tishipayu iyie pee imayian enkaji osinka lino, pee etum ashomo dukuya ntarasi te dukuya iyie; amu ore iyie, ee Olaitoriani Enkai, niroro, naa te mayianata ino emayiani enkaji o sinka lino ntarasi.”",
          "type": "text",
